    "NSFaceIDUsageDescription" : {
      "comment" : "Privacy - Face ID Usage Description. Shown under the system's question whether the app may use Face ID (iPhone, iPad) or Optic ID (Apple Vision Pro); \"this\" is that feature. Do not name Face ID here: the same text is in the Mac app.",
